[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Firmware Architecture Description for GBSK
UID: DHF-GBSK-0031

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to describe the top-level architecture for the firmware components, developed by Voxel Ray, for the GBSK system.

This document presents the firmware components from multiple points of view, describing the system context, physical mapping to processors, logical software items including SOUP components, developer configurations, and other viewpoints.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes the firmware components for the GBSK system at a high-level. The document does not address requirements, electro-mechanical designs, detailed software designs, or verification protocols (all of which are covered by other project documents).

\*The term Software relates to both software and firmware subsystems.
<<<

